      "unresolved": [
        "Natural scheduling into the typed origin 12223 is not established: what hands off to 29C.MES is not named here.",
        "The callee closes its own gate (global_u8[1115] = 1 at 4009), sets global_u8[1112] = 1 at 4020, stamps banked_u16[242] = 29 at 4031, and sets global_u8[286] = 1 at 4045 -- and leaves by FLOOR4.MES even when its own gate is already closed (the done-gate's false target, 4031, lands on the same stamp-and-door path as the open-gate fallthrough).",
        "No affection word (banked_u16[200..215]) write was found anywhere in the callee -- confirmed by static decode and by an empty diagnostic scan of that range across the measured baseline run.",
